  #line-at(259.26pt, 588.78pt, " factors of about 1,000 results in an inherent narrow bandwidth ")
  #line-at(72pt, 601.44pt, "of tens kilohertz, insufficient for advanced gate driving in wide-bandgap (WBG) power electronics, where ")
  #line-at(72pt, 614.1pt, "sub-micro-second transitions are required. ")
  #line-at(72pt, 634.74pt, "      In this Article, we demonstrate isolated power and signal co-transmission using a small-footprint ")
