  #line-at(513pt, 235.02pt, "). The ")
  #line-at(72pt, 247.68pt, "variance in the transmission spectrum is due to the reflections between IDTs, which does not affect the gate ")
  #line-at(72pt, 260.34pt, "driving performance. We note that the maximum ")
