  #line-at(72pt, 528.24pt, "The choice of acoustic-wave frequency around 200 MHz balances the instantaneous bandwidth and power ")
  #line-at(72pt, 540.9pt, "handling capabilities. A higher frequency device can lead to larger instantaneous bandwidth, meanwhile its ")
  #line-at(72pt, 553.5pt, "smaller pitch of electrode limits the maximum voltage can be applied at input. On LN substrate, a typical ")
  #line-at(72pt, 566.16pt, "device instantaneous bandwidth is about 10% of the carrier frequency for efficient IDTs (as a result of the ")
  #line-at(72pt, 579.24pt, "electromechanical coupling coefficient ")
