  #line-at(166.08pt, 576.42pt, " transits between 10% and 90% of its peak value. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.97pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 594.84pt, "DC-DC buck converter ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.01pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 606.6pt, "We build our buck converter using two GS-065-011-1L GaN HEMTs (")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.01pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(360.72pt, 606.6pt, "Fig. 4a")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.01pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(390.18pt, 606.6pt, "). Also, a low-pass filter, including a ")
  #line-at(72pt, 618.12pt, "132 μH inductor (L), 4.2 μF capacitor (C")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.474pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(236.22pt, 619.14pt, "out")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.01pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(244.5pt, 618.12pt, "), enables DC output to an 8 Ω electronic load (R")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.474pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(441.96pt, 619.14pt, "load")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.01pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(453.12pt, 618.12pt, ", Rigol DL3031). The ")
  #line-at(72pt, 629.58pt, "DC power supply of 15 V is provided by Rigol DP831A. The high-side HEMT is gate controlled by our SAW device, ")
  #line-at(72pt, 641.1pt, "switching on and off at 50 kHz with 50% duty cycle. We short the gate and source of the low-side HEMT. When the ")
  #line-at(72pt, 652.62pt, "high side HEMT is off, the inductor current can still be reversely conducted by the low-side HEMT working in the ")
  #line-at(72pt, 664.08pt, "third quadrant. However, the low side HEMT presents higher drain-to-source voltage drop in reverse conduction mode ")
  #line-at(72pt, 675.6pt, "during converter operation. This explains the relatively low efficiency of 73.7% of our converter. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.97pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
